   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How it is formed",
     "texto": [
      "**Essere** (in the appropriate tense) + past participle, which agrees with the subject: **Il quadro è stato dipinto** (the painting was painted), **La casa è stata costruita** (the house was built).",
      "The agent can go with **da**: **dipinto da un artista** (painted by an artist)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Present: state or action",
     "texto": [
      "**Il quadro è dipinto** can describe the result («the painting is finished») or a habitual or passive action, depending on the context. To stress an action in progress or repeated, you can use **venire**: **Il quadro viene dipinto dall'artista** (the painting is painted by the artist).",
      "In texts, the context makes the meaning clear."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
